\f1\b \cf4 7. Domain Name
\f0\b0 \cf2                                             \
                \
  Register a domain (e.g., \cf5 \cb3 contiq.app\cf2 \cb3 , \cf5 \cb3 contiq.io\cf2 \cb3 ) \'97 $10\'9615/yr via Namecheap or Cloudflare Registrar. Point it to Vercel (frontend) and Railway (backend, e.g., \cf5 \cb3 api.contiq.app\cf2 \cb3 ).\
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  ---\
  
\f1\b \cf4 8. Database Index (Prevents Timeouts)
\f0\b0 \cf2                                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                            \
  Run this on Supabase before launch:\
  \cf6 \cb3 CREATE\cf2 \cb3  INDEX IF \cf6 \cb3 NOT\cf2 \cb3  \cf6 \cb3 EXISTS\cf2 \cb3  idx_content_items_user_created                                                                                                                                               \
  \cf6 \cb3 ON\cf2 \cb3  content_items(user_id, created_at \cf6 \cb3 DESC\cf2 \cb3 );\
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  ---                                                       \
  
\f1\b \cf4 \uc0\u55357 \u57312  Security Hardening
\f0\b0 \cf2                                                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                            \
  ---\
  
\f1\b \cf4 9. Rate Limiting
\f0\b0 \cf2 \
                  \
  Currently zero rate limiting on any endpoint. An AI endpoint (e.g., \cf5 \cb3 /agents/trends\cf2 \cb3 ) can be called hundreds of times per minute, draining your Groq/Tavily/fal.ai quotas and running up costs.\
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  Add \cf5 \cb3 slowapi\cf2 \cb3  (FastAPI rate limiter) \'97 simple decorator-based, ~30 min to add:                                                                                                                            \
  \cf7 \cb3 @limiter.limit(\cf8 "10/minute"\cf7 )\cf2 \cb3                                                                                                                                                                              \
  \cf7 \cb3 @router.post(\cf8 "/trends"\cf7 )\cf2 \cb3                                                                                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
  
\f1\b \cf4 10. API Key Exposure
\f0\b0 \cf2                                                                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  Verify that no API keys are committed to git. Run:        \
  git \cf9 \cb3 log\cf2 \cb3  --all -p | grep -E \cf8 \cb3 "(GROQ|TAVILY|FAL|SUPABASE|CLERK|STRIPE)"\cf2 \cb3  | head -20                                                                                                                         \
  Add a \cf5 \cb3 .gitignore\cf2 \cb3  check: \cf5 \cb3 backend/.env\cf2 \cb3  and \cf5 \cb3 frontend/.env.local\cf2 \cb3  must be ignored.  \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                     \
  
