\f1\b \cf4 12. Facebook & Instagram App Review
\f0\b0 \cf2                                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  Meta requires app review before you can request permissions (\cf5 \cb3 pages_manage_posts\cf2 \cb3 , \cf5 \cb3 instagram_basic\cf2 \cb3 , etc.) from users outside your test users list. This takes 
\f1\b \cf4 1\'964 weeks
\f0\b0 \cf2 . Submit early.                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  
\f1\b \cf4 13. Twitter/X API Access
\f0\b0 \cf2                                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                            \
  The free tier of Twitter API v2 has very limited write access. You may need 
\f1\b \cf4 Basic tier ($100/mo)
\f0\b0 \cf2  for meaningful posting. Check your current access level.                                               \
