  - Frontend: \cf5 \cb3 @sentry/nextjs\cf2 \cb3                                                                                                                                                                               \
  - Backend: \cf5 \cb3 sentry-sdk[fastapi]\cf2 \cb3 \
  - ~2 hours to integrate                                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                          \
  
